Subject: [PATCH 06860/11362] [outer-loop] ARC sk48 round-4: honest null,
 confirms B glyph is level-3-only obstacle

Round-4 codex gpt-5.6-sol attempt on sk48 tried direct probes, the L2
construction, scaled row-reversal plans, and explicit interaction with the
color-11 B glyph -- none advanced level 3. Confirms round-3's diagnosis
that the B glyph (absent in L1/L2) is the level-3-specific obstacle
resisting the pull/lift/merge/row-reversal constructions that solved
L1/L2, and reconfirms direct ACTION6/ACTION5 interaction has no visible
effect on it.

Chose to preserve budget for the reproduction gate (passed for level 2)
rather than risk an unverified level-3 claim. No registry count change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JntPrUGLNesPcJH1pyfFYw
